        "original_id": "3da6a3b5-3ccf-57fd-a8b5-b8bebb9cb9a6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leonard Nimoy, William Shatner, DeForest Kelley, Doctor Leonard McCoy, Kirk, Spock\n- Works: The City on the Edge of Forever\n- Topics: Time travel, timeline correction, acting and entertainment careers\n\nFacts:\n- In the episode \"The City on the Edge of Forever,\" Doctor Leonard McCoy, played by DeForest Kelley, travels back in time and changes history.\n- In the episode \"The City on the Edge of Forever,\" Kirk, played by William Shatner, and Spock, played by Leonard Nimoy, follow Doctor Leonard McCoy to correct the timeline.\n- Leonard Simon Nimoy was born on March 26, 1931.\n- Leonard Simon Nimoy was an American actor, film director, photographer, author, singer, and songwriter.\n- Leonard Simon Nimoy died on February 27, 2015.",
